            "1 Khuksunna ’tyan tu ’chamc kho,",
            "Khuksunna, khuksunna;",
            "Khuksunna ’tyan tu ’chamc kho,",
            "Khuksunna, khuksunna;",
            "Ai khuksun key khou hei",
            "Theicloumei kros ta zauc e,",
            "He Pou, zauc-nzianlou o.",
            "",
            "2 Kaipouc buangc hei puanc ’chamc kho,",
